# Docker build contexts are the workspace root (Dockerfiles COPY repo-relative
# paths). Keep local development TLS material — leaves, private keys, PKCS12
# keystores/truststores (`nx certgen`) — out of every image: no Dockerfile
# needs them (services bind-mount their certs/ instead), and an image is a
# distribution artifact while this material is dev-only identity (ADR 006).
**/certs/
**/.env
**/.env.enc
secrets/
.venv/
.git/
site/
build/
coverage/
node_modules/
